<div class="container section">
    <div class="about-intro">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>Lulu Mart started with a simple idea: pet parents deserve a trusted, easy place to shop for everything their companions need - food, toys, beds, grooming and more - without hopping between stores. Today, we bring together multiple independent sellers offering quality checked pet products under one roof (this demo), with transparent ratings and simple order tracking.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="why-grid" id="trust">
        <div class="why-card"><span class="why-icon">🗂️</span><h3>Curated sellers</h3><p>Every seller is reviewed before they can list products on Lulu Mart.</p></div>
        <div class="why-card"><span class="why-icon">⭐</span><h3>Real reviews</h3><p>Only buyers who received an order can review products, keeping feedback honest.</p></div>
        <div class="why-card"><span class="why-icon">🛡️</span><h3>Buyer protection</h3><p>Mock secure payments (UPI / card / COD) and a clear order status flow.</p></div>
        <div class="why-card"><span class="why-icon">🐾</span><h3>Pet happy</h3><p>Our inventory is pet-only, so everything you see is for the furry, feathered and finned.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-intro" id="pets">
        <h2>Pets We Love</h2>
        <p>Dogs, cats, birds, rabbits, hamsters, guinea pigs, fish, turtles, reptiles and more. If it has paws, fins or feathers, we've got products for it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-intro">
        <h2>Demo Notice</h2>
        <p>This is a fictitious academic marketplace. No real orders or payments are processed. Use the demo accounts shown on the login page to explore buyer, seller and admin experiences.</p>
    </div>
</div>

